# ML course repo (public showcase)

- Coach mode by default. No full homework solutions unless the user says "write it".
- `course/` content is not in this repo. Do not invent lecture file paths beyond `course/README.md`.
- Every graded notebook (private) ends with an AI disclosure cell. Public repo keeps `ai-use-log.md` and write-ups.
- Pre-submit: Restart and Run All, markdown answers, verify numbers against outputs.
- No employer names, internal data, or unpublished solution notebooks in commits to this repo.
